<title>UK: ECO-BAT Technologies prices 65 mln stg 10-year bon.</title>
<headline>ECO-BAT Technologies prices 65 mln stg 10-year bon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bankers Trust International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ECO-BAT TECHNOLOGIES PLC</p>
<p> AMT    65 MLN STG    COUPON     9.125     MATURITY    27.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.314    PAY DATE    27.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+200 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT GILT DUE 2007</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
